---
const arrow = "M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6";
---
<section class="workshop-hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="workshop-title" data-workshop-hero>
  <div class="workshop-room" role="img" aria-label="Models of Miguel’s impedance matcher, embedded vehicle and collection robot on workshop display blocks.">
    <div class="workshop-room-canvas">
    <picture class="workshop-scene workshop-scene--light workshop-scene--still" aria-hidden="true">
      <source srcset="/assets/workshop/workshop-light.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img src="/assets/workshop/workshop-light.webp" width="1920" height="1200" alt="Miguel’s impedance matcher, embedded vehicle and collection robot models on three workshop display blocks." loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" />
    </picture>
    <picture class="workshop-scene workshop-scene--dark workshop-scene--still" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/workshop/workshop-dark.webp" width="1920" height="1200" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </picture>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="workshop-hero-copy">
    <h1 id="workshop-title">A curious mind.<br />A <em>working</em><br />circuit.</h1>
    <p>I'm Miguel, an electrical &amp; computer engineer at Carnegie Mellon. I bring hardware, firmware, and a little imagination together.</p>
    <a class="workshop-link" href="#project-matcher">Explore my work <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={arrow} /></svg></a>
  </div>
  <div class="workshop-hero-foot">
    <p>B.S. + M.S. at Carnegie Mellon<br />Available after May 2027</p>
    <a class="workshop-scroll" href="#project-matcher" aria-label="Scroll to selected engineering projects"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16M6 14l6 6 6-6" /></svg><span>Have a look around</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
